	</ul>

	<p>After placing the furniture in its designated location, it is essential to remove all packing debris promptly:</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Removing Packing Materials:</strong> Collect and dispose of all packing materials such as bubble wrap, foam, cardboard boxes, and foam peanuts.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Cleaning Area:</strong> Clean the area where the furniture was placed to ensure it is tidy and free of debris.</span></li>
